          "page": "1",
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "AlCoCrFeNi2.1 eutectic high entropy alloy (EHEA), with its unique in-situ composite structure, not only overcomes the shortcoming of insufficient strength for face-centered-cubic (FCC) single-phase high entropy alloy (HEA), but also overcomes the shortcoming of insufficient ductility for body-centered-cubic (BCC) single-phase HEA, thus attracting widespread attention from the academic community.",
