          "page": "2",
          "section": "2.1. Material fabrication and samples preparation",
          "quote": "All the specimens were printed by a SLM equipment (Metal Laser 3D Printer (NCL–M2150T) equipped with a 500 W IPG laser). The laser generator has a maximum power of 500 W and a laser spot diameter of 70 μm. The optimized printing parameters are as follows: laser power of 240 W, scanning speed of 900 mm/s, hatch spacing of 70 μm, layer thickness of 30 μm and rotation angle of 67◦ between successive layers. Additionally, the printing process was performed under the protection of high-purity argon gas to minimize potential oxidation.",
